{"publicId":"837e540e-5e37-46b0-b6a5-212f421155da","title":"迪士尼基于AWS云与AI推出新Star Wars动画机器人Anzellans","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T17:50:57.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-18T17:50:57.000Z","digest":"迪士尼推出三款基于AWS云服务器与AI模型的Star Wars动画机器人Anzellans（Vilo Vele、Kado Bre'a、Jibu Bre'a），所有动作和台词均由 Imagineers团队预先编写脚本，确保角色个性特征（如说话节奏、肢体语言）严格符合设定。与旧版Olaf机器人（通过Steam Deck手动操控）不同，新机型配备隐藏摄像头和麦克风，实时采集游客动作与语音指令后，经AWS云端多AI模型处理，仅触发预设脚本中的对应反应，不自主生成内容。目前该技术仅应用于迪士尼乐园内特定展区，未公布商业化计划或数据使用范围。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-18T18:23:15.225Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"迪士尼新 Star Wars 动画机器人通过 AWS 云与 AI 实时互动","latestReport":{"id":"v4wb2g97a7d11srjx585nisdi"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fMRWK4CoXnXc","title":"Disney’s new Star Wars animatronics interact with guests usi","firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T17:50:57.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"v4wb2g97a7d11srjx585nisdi","title":"迪士尼新 Star Wars 动画机器人通过 AWS 云与 AI 实时互动","summary":"迪士尼发布基于 AWS 云和 AI 的 Star Wars 动画机器人原型，包含 Vilo Vele、Kado Bre'a、Jibu Bre'a 三个 Anzellans 角色模型。","source":{"name":"The Verge · AI","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T17:50:57.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"v4wb2g97a7d11srjx585nisdi","title":"迪士尼新 Star Wars 动画机器人通过 AWS 云与 AI 实时互动","summary":"迪士尼发布基于 AWS 云和 AI 的 Star Wars 动画机器人原型，包含 Vilo Vele、Kado Bre'a、Jibu Bre'a 三个 Anzellans 角色模型。","source":{"name":"The Verge · AI","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T17:50:57.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-18T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T21:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z","heat":8.4,"par